                                "sense_id": "258a0022-e360-3516-bc33-26225277595a",
                                "text": "2008, Lou Schuler, \"Foreward\", in Nate Green, Built for Show, page xi\n[…] the pubescent male brain isn't noted for its consistent engagement with reality […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1ad8535b-f77a-410f-912d-da353f32a8e2",
                                "sense_id": "258a0022-e360-3516-bc33-26225277595a",
                                "text": "The 18-year-old [Justin] Bieber can’t quite pull off the “adult” thing just yet: His voice may have dropped a bit since the days of “Baby,” but it still mostly registers as “angelic,” and veers toward a pubescent whine at times."
                            }
                        ]
